eated as actual people rather than just a sidenote.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2484"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T03:44:49-08:00","id":1057520,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ana Mizuki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1055797-thoughts-on-future-werewolf-5ed-by-looking-at-the-bns-book?p=1057519#post1057519\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span class=\"b-bbcode-user js-bbcode-user\">Guest</span> I think no one here wants a sweet and problemless WtA. The reason we are discussing this is due to not accidentally using ideas and stereotypes that have nothing in common with the cultures and countries in reality. As in, we aren't just continuing the old beliefs even if accidentally.<br /> <br /> Even if it doesn't seem like such a big deal, the fact is that people of colour and people from countries other than america do play WtA. And they have the right to expect to be treated as actual people rather than just a sidenote.</div> </div> </div> </div>Would smash the like a lot more then once if I could","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1179-celtspz","name":"CeltSPZ","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1179_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"835"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T04:15:26-08:00","id":1057529,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Darksider</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1055797-thoughts-on-future-werewolf-5ed-by-looking-at-the-bns-book?p=1057487#post1057487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Wisdominchains, stop the threadcrapping. I'll cut you some slack since you are apparently a new forum user but if the thread crap posts continue it will result in disciplinary action. People have been banned for it before, don't be that guy.</span></div> </div> </div> </div>It's cool, I'm going to take a hike. This forums not for me. I appreciate the ideas. Gracias everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12902-wisdominchains","name":"WISDOMINCHAINS","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12902_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"139"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T06:04:38-08:00","id":1057560,"title":"","content":"We aren't asking to remove In Character racism. The Get and the Black Furies are still going to think poorly of the other tribe as a whole. We just want the more ethnic tribes to be presented without racial stereotypes.<br /> <br /> Let's use an example that removes racism from the picture. The change to the Glasswalkers mentioned above? In Character, all the other tribes see Glasswalkers as Weaver loving cowards that live in their mother's basement playing with computers and guns all day. That is a stereotype that Glasswalkers have to live with. <br /> <br /> However, Glasswalkers themselves are a diverse group of individuals who understand the Weaver is a Tool that can be used to defeat the Wyrm and control the spread of the Weaver. They understand how dangerous the Weaver is. They have more experience with the trait than any tribe. <br /> <br /> Thus out of character, the Glasswalkers aren't Weaver loving bastards. They aren't a walking stereotype, but a tribe of individuals with an unique view point. <br /> <br /> That is all we are asking for. The Garou Nation could still wrestle with Sexism and Racism, but the books themselves present all the tribes in a respectful manner.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T09:58:56-08:00","id":1057641,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>idpersona</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1055797-thoughts-on-future-werewolf-5ed-by-looking-at-the-bns-book?p=1055852#post1055852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... So what's going on with the eighth sign?</div> </div> </div> </div>Read the opening comic in W20 and see...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2582-gangrel44","name":"Gangrel44","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2582_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"151"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-03T14:22:54-08:00","id":1057763,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gangrel44</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1055797-thoughts-on-future-werewolf-5ed-by-looking-at-the-bns-book?p=1057641#post1057641\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Read the opening comic in W20 and see...</div> </div> </div> </div>It being basically a &quot;Stand up and fight, despairing won't get you anywhere&quot; message.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"