use movie theater producers.&quot;, &quot; movie and theatre production,<br /> social media, and tourism.&quot;, &quot; College professors, performance drummers, opera singers,<br /> and sports announcers&quot;, &quot; gossip reporters, human relations managers, and publicists.&quot;, &quot; translators, foreign language instructors, or ethnomusicologists.&quot;, &quot; archaeologists, puzzle<br /> designers, or researchers.&quot;, &quot; artists or performers, and are found in professions<br /> such as teaching.&quot;, &quot; musicians, flmmakers, and artisans&quot;, &quot; creative arts, with anthropology,<br /> history, and music&quot;<br /> <br /> Ahroun: &quot; They are frequently professional fighters, front-line combatants, or law enforcement<br /> offcers&quot;, &quot; Gruff old war veterans, gang members, physical trainers and construction workers&quot;, &quot; In addition to being combat medics, Children<br /> of Gaia Ahroun often work bodyguarding controversial<br /> personalities, and serving as bouncers and security guards at<br /> highly-charged political and community events.&quot;, &quot; wrestlers, club owners,<br /> or personal trainers.&quot;, &quot; child protective services, bodyguards, or personal trainers&quot; , &quot; muscle, corporate sharks, club owners, or even drill sergeants&quot;, &quot; foreign legions, diplomatic protection details, and sky<br /> marshals on commercial flights.&quot;, &quot; military offcers, professional<br /> sports players, and serve in high-pressure positions such as<br /> emergency medical felds&quot;, &quot; personal trainers, tacticians,<br /> and in various security positions.&quot;, &quot; forest<br /> rangers, bodyguards, and survivalists.&quot;, &quot; martial arts instructors, police<br /> offcers, and military academy professors&quot;<br /> <br /> </div></div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> Just, look at the lists. Some DO make sense, but others just baffle me. Especially ones that require a lot of time work