forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1055797-thoughts-on-future-werewolf-5ed-by-looking-at-the-bns-book?p=1059729#post1059729\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well, this is a double post, but I gotta say this; for all the Furies accepting males and other tries to be more accepting, they actually kept in a lot of the old things that could have used changing. Fenrir did this weird rewind back to 2nd ed with their views on race, Red Talon section almost -screams- to use the words alpha and omega, and so on.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That is distressing. Furies accepting males, yet Get being racist screams &quot;Prejudice is okay as long as it isn't against me and mine.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T14:41:30-08:00","id":1059760,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1055797-thoughts-on-future-werewolf-5ed-by-looking-at-the-bns-book?p=1059735#post1059735\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> That is distressing. Furies accepting males, yet Get being racist screams &quot;Prejudice is okay as long as it isn't against me and mine.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>I think the Red Talon section is the worst. Putting aside the constant concept of dominance, it is said they have recovered their numbers and then some thanks to wolf preservation and the short maturation time of wolves vs humans. And now they are on the warpath, the once secret Winter Packs (which the tribebook noted there being only -one- in existence at that point) are now being formed around the world. And camps like Whelp's Compromise are now pushed to the edges. Also, the potentially Wyrm Tainted camp of Dying Cubs? They got to merge with the Pro-Impegrium Camp.<br /> <br /> There is a lot of stuff to unpack here, but I start with the numbers. If Red Talons suddenly saw their kinfolk and garou numbers rise, and due to humans? They would not go on a warpath. A huge point about how they act in the setting currently is, that they have all but given up hope of surviving. That is why they lash out. Having more kin all of a sudden? It would actually calm them down a lot. And the Winter Packs and Dying Cubs? The former is super secret thing and the other is Wyrm tainted, Red Talons aren't going to accep them just randomly. And Whelp's Compromise should be respected more, since they were right about humans.<br /> <br /> Basically, they all but planted horns and pitchforks onto these guys to make them baddy bad guys.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://ana-mizuki.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My gallery.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/110-ana-mizuki","name":"Ana Mizuki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar110_2.png","title":"Member","