re, since they were right about humans.<br /> <br /> Basically, they all but planted horns and pitchforks onto these guys to make them baddy bad guys.</div> </div> </div> </div>So... OP is still publishing W20 books right?<br /> <br /> (I know got an answer earlier in the thread, but damn I really hope OP is still producing W20 books beyond what is in the pipeline.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I write things.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3950-wonderandawe","name":"wonderandawe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3950_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5410"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-03-07T15:21:26-08:00","id":1059781,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wonderandawe</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/1055797-thoughts-on-future-werewolf-5ed-by-looking-at-the-bns-book?p=1059762#post1059762\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> So... OP is still publishing W20 books right?<br /> <br /> (I know got an answer earlier in the thread, but damn I really hope OP is still producing W20 books beyond what is in the pipeline.)</div> </div> </div> </div>Well they have changing ways and the dice roller in the works","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13009-burritomage","name":"Burr